  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "21. Flying and Surging",
    "ruleNumber": "21.02",
    "summary": "A rule that grants a Surge supplies its maximum distance. The unit must be Unengaged, not Battle-shocked, and have made no move this phase. Follow [Moving](vsdata:core-rule/moving) and use the closest enemy unit as the target. Each model must finish Engaged with that enemy if possible. Otherwise, move it as close to the target as it can get. The unit must finish clear of engagement with every other enemy and cannot move again this phase.",
